  "description": "Out-of-process OpenTelemetry capture for Kronikol: an OTLP/HTTP trace receiver-tee that accepts `POST /v1/traces` (protobuf and JSON, gzip), optionally forwards the export byte-for-byte to a real collector, and maps database, HTTP, messaging and RPC client spans to Kronikol interactions attributed by W3C trace id. Gives sequence diagrams exact attribution for hops that cannot be proxied, in any language that already exports OTLP. Also the outbound direction: `OtlpExporter` and the streaming `OtlpExportSink` push Kronikol's captured interactions to Tempo/Jaeger/any collector as OTel spans over OTLP/JSON, preserving captured W3C ids and grouping one test as one trace.",
